<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.49 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.49 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.49 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.89 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.98 vs   0.56</p>
<p> Sales		   24.58 vs  15.93</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.51 vs   5.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.94 vs   8.37</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.51 vs   4.86</p>
<p> Sales		  197.94 vs 141.76</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat producer is Sokolow SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
